Repository license — STATUS (pending author confirmation)
=========================================================

This file records the provenance of every part of this release and the license that each
part carries. **No blanket license for the whole repository is granted by this file.** The
authors have not yet confirmed the terms under which the repository as a whole is released;
until then, treat any file not explicitly covered below as "all rights reserved / pending".

Nothing in this file should be read as the repository being released under `UNLICENSED` as a
*chosen* license — it is the opposite: it states that licensing has not yet been decided.

