--------------------------------------------------------------------
    src/backbones/dinov2/  (models/, layers/)

Vendored (pruned to the vit encoder + layers the release needs) from
https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2 . The source files carry the Meta Apache-2.0
header notice. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

